# S18, member a (k10, slot 0): with b through the lobby gate and west to stag0101's matz02 (to stag0102).
# 1. a steps on and answers No: it stays, on the mat.
# 2. b steps on (b's own prompt, b says No) and off again: a is never asked meanwhile.
# 3. a steps off and on again and answers Yes once b stands on the mat too (b is not asked while a's exit runs, then
#    asked after a's Yes); b says No: only a leaves (a fork).
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@90
explore mate00 yes until stage=stag0101,control
log in the field
route {route:stag0101_west}
wander -310 -190 8 until sealed>=8800
log case 1: a steps on and answers no
mat matz02 no until answered>=1,prompt=0,frames>=60 fail stagechange
log a said no and stays on the mat
idle until onmat:matz02>=2 fail asked,stagechange
log b on the mat
idle until onmat:matz02<=1,frames>=120 fail asked,stagechange
log b stepped off: no prompt for a
goto -350 -190 5 fail stagechange
idle until frames>=180
log case 3: a steps on again and answers yes once b is on the mat
mat matz02 yes 2 until stage=stag0102,control
log a left alone
idle until frames>=300
